        "meaning": "Reject the matching staged flow. If the app cannot be satisfied without it, reject the pipeline."
      },
      {
        "term": "ALLOW_IF",
        "meaning": "Allow the matching staged flow only if required conditions are present and forbidden conditions are absent."
      },
      {
        "term": "REQUIRE_CONDITION",
        "meaning": "Add/check an obligation such as disclosure, local processing, or retention limit."
      },
      {
        "term": "REQUIRE_TRANSFORMATION",
        "meaning": "Insert/check a privacy transformation before output to the downstream app."
      },
      {
        "term": "CLASSIFY_AS",
        "meaning": "Add a tag such as surveillance_device_flow or phi_like_flow for subsequent rules."
      },
      {
        "term": "REQUIRE_REVIEW",
        "meaning": "Escalate candidate flow or pipeline for human/deployment review."
      },
      {
        "term": "PREFER",
